.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929040/extras/62380ec4cb21f216ebfb0eb51eca6fbf.mp4?t=1788291097\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929040/extras/104a6cc9beb7cd9ecd633457194b1117.avif?t=1788291097\" width=800 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run gives you a chance to shape a different kind of fleet. Spend resources, unlock new squadron options, and combine units with upgrades that change how you approach each encounter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The goal is not only to survive the next battle, but to create momentum. A small strike force can grow into a powerful armada if you make the right calls at the right time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929040/extras/222eb58acd8f695305fcf99890af64be.poster.avif?t=1788291097\" width=1170 height=506 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929040/extras/222eb58acd8f695305fcf99890af64be.webm?t=1788291097\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929040/extras/222eb58acd8f695305fcf99890af64be.mp4?t=1788291097\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929040/extras/97e8946b2d5b24e7e38b4492d49a4dde.avif?t=1788291097\" width=800 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fleetbreakers blends real-time tactical combat with roguelite structure. Each run brings generated maps, new encounters, discoveries, allies, and strategic choices that can change your route through the sector.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Push forw