amstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929040/extras/2970b37fdbb8ab6a5975c412cb9e3987.mp4?t=1788291097\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929040/extras/c18e8cc551f55d9f7810f030480adc40.avif?t=1788291097\" width=800 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fleetbreakers is designed around quick missions that get you into the action fast. Each encounter gives you a clear tactical problem: deploy, adapt, survive, and decide how far you are willing to push before the enemy pushes back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with mouse and keyboard or gamepad, and take the fight on the go with Steam Deck-ready sessions built around fast, focused strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929040/extras/901da9abb952c843296eabe136cf793a.poster.avif?t=1788291097\" width=1170 height=506 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929040/extras/901da9abb952c843296eabe136cf793a.webm?t=1788291097\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929040/extras/901da9abb952c843296eabe136cf793a.mp4?t=1788291097\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929040/extras/c607e1fa8b77f7913372d4ec25f7b9a4.avif?t=1788291097\" width=800 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >·         <strong>Fast action RTS roguelite - </strong>quick, replayable missions where every battle and upgrade shapes the campaign.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >·         <strong>Tactical squadron combat - </strong>deploy fighters, heavy units, and special maneuvers in real-time space battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >·         <strong>Mothership command abilities - </strong>call in powerful support to protect your fleet or break enemy formations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >·         <strong>Persistent progression - </strong>spend resources on upgrades that carry your campaign forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >·         <strong>Dynamic campaign structure - </strong>generated maps, encounters, discoveries, allies, boss battles, and route choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >·         <strong>Multiple factions and allied bonuses - </strong>unlock new advantages that change how each run unfolds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >·         <strong>Flexible controls - </strong>mouse and keyboard, gamepad support, and Steam Deck-ready play.</p>", "short_description": "From the creators of Halo Wars and Age of Empires, Fleetbreakers is an action RTS roguelite with satisfying fleet combat in bite-sized sessions. Strategic depth meets cataclysmic space battles in an ever-evolving campaign that keeps you coming back for just. One. More. Run.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Arabic, Japanese, Korean, Portuguese - Brazil, Simplified Chinese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929040/a96a837f6dc83445ac4ab6630d05d6a05696eae5/header.jpg?t=1788291097", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929040/afec61c05d1aa87d654962cf1e1fff03a633853c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788291097", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929040/afec61c05d1aa87d654962cf1e1fff03a633853c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788291097", "website": "https://www.lastkeep.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></l